  "reevaluate_instruction": "A fresh snapshot acquisition for the workspace is needed, and after identification of the warmest freezer, inspection of its sensor history should follow."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "I need to find the campaign that’s currently delivering the weakest conversion rate across our accounts. Once you’ve identified it, please refresh the workspace data so we’re working with the latest performance snapshot. After that, pause that exact campaign immediately.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "First, pull the most recent performance snapshot into the workspace so nothing is stale. Then locate the campaign with the lowest conversion rate in the updated view. Once you’ve confirmed which one it is, go ahead and pause it."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "Could you (after we pull the latest workspace snapshot) open the renewal checklist for the contract whose renewal day falls earliest?",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "Please refresh the workspace first, then open the renewal checklist for the contract with the earliest renewal day (I mean the one that comes up after the update)."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "We just received a fresh telemetry snapshot for the downtown substation. Identify the meter with the highest load from that data, and once you have it, dispatch an inspection for that meter.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "First, pull the latest telemetry snapshot for the downtown substation. After the workspace has the newer data, identify the meter with the highest load and dispatch an inspection for it."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "I need to quarantine the batch that currently shows the highest defect rate. First, pull the latest quality snapshot into the workspace so the defect figures are up to date, then quarantine that same batch.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "Please refresh the workspace with the newest quality snapshot, then identify whichever batch now has the highest defect rate and quarantine it."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "First, identify the submission that received the lowest score. After the workspace has been refreshed to its latest state, request a revision for that lowest-scoring submission.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "After the workspace has been refreshed to its latest state, identify the submission that received the lowest score and then request a revision for it."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "I need to check which room currently has the highest cleaning priority. Please pull the latest snapshot of the workspace so the data is up to date. Once that's done, open the inspection form for that room.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "Before I pick a room, please refresh the workspace with a newer snapshot. After the update, find the room with the highest cleaning priority and open its inspection form."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "I need to (after the workspace refreshes its snapshot) open the risk note for the holding with the highest exposure—please make sure you’ve identified that one first.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "Please (once the workspace has a newer snapshot) open the risk note for the holding with the highest exposure—I’ll let you determine which one that is after the update."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "We just pulled the latest soil moisture data from the fields. I need you to identify the plot with the lowest moisture reading. Once you have that, refresh the workspace to make sure we’re working with the most recent snapshot, and then schedule irrigation for that same plot.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "First, refresh the workspace so we’re looking at the newest snapshot of the fields. After that, find the plot with the lowest moisture reading, and schedule irrigation for that plot."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "I need to transcode the largest asset in the workspace, but first pull the latest snapshot so we’re working with current metadata. Once that’s done, start a transcode for that same asset.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "Please refresh the workspace to the newest snapshot, then identify the asset with the largest file size and start a transcode for it."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "Identification of the promotion with the earliest expiry day should be followed by a workspace refresh, and then the opening of the review sheet for that promotion.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "A workspace refresh should be performed before the identification of the promotion with the earliest expiry day, and then the opening of the review sheet for that promotion."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "I need to check which grant currently has the highest urgency score. Once the workspace refreshes with the latest data, please open the escalation brief for that grant.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "Please refresh the workspace to get the most recent snapshot. After that, identify the grant with the highest urgency score and open its escalation brief."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "First, find the link with the highest latency (you may need to refresh the workspace snapshot to get current metrics), then open the rerouting panel for that link.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "Refresh the workspace snapshot to get the latest metrics, then (once you have the updated view) locate the link with the highest latency and open the rerouting panel for it."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "We just pulled the latest queue snapshot into the workspace. Among all pending orders, find the one that has been waiting the longest. Open the service check for that order.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "First refresh the workspace with the newest queue data. Then, once the snapshot is current, identify the order that has been waiting the longest and open the service check for it."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "First, find the claim that currently has the highest review score. Then, make sure the workspace is refreshed to the latest snapshot. After that, flag that same claim for further investigation.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "Please refresh the workspace to the most recent snapshot first. Once that's done, identify the claim with the highest review score and flag it for follow-up."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "Identification of the most overdue inspection is needed first. After a workspace refresh, assignment of a follow-up for that inspection should be carried out.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "A workspace refresh should be performed before any identification. Once the snapshot is current, assignment of a follow-up for the most overdue inspection must be completed."
}

{
