  "reevaluate_instruction": "First, please update the workspace to the latest snapshot. Then I'd like you to locate the oldest hold request. After you've identified it, notify the patron for that hold request."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "We need to dispatch collection for the container that currently shows the highest fill level (please pull the latest sensor readings first, so we’re working from an up-to-date snapshot) and then send the truck to that same bin.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "First, refresh the workspace with the newest fill-level snapshot, and once that’s loaded, dispatch collection for the container that ends up with the highest fill level (and, of course, route the truck to that exact bin)."
}

{
  "preserve_instruction": "We just pulled the latest workspace snapshot, and I need to check the workcell that’s been throwing the most faults. Open diagnostics for that workcell.",
  "reevaluate_instruction": "First, refresh the workspace snapshot so we’re looking at current data. Then, open diagnostics for the workcell with the highest fault count."
}

{
